  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Softly earmarked support to innovation, WFP 2023 - 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WFP&apos;s regional innovation hub, located in Nairobi, aims at fostering locally-led food systems innovation and strengthening of institutional capacity for innovation and learning in East Africa. The regional innovation hub works on a climate resilience programme in partnership with CARE Denmark. The regional innovation hub is also involved in a Next Generation Programme for youth innovators in partnership with the Technical University of Denmark (DTU).</narrative>
  </description>
